{"genre": "WritingPrompts", "passage_A": "In the tranquil city of Harmonyville once lived a former super villain named Draven. After years of chaos and destruction, he had decided to change his ways, leaving his criminal past behind. Now, he devoted his days to caring for his young daughter, Lily, who was the joy of his life.

One bright morning, Draven and Lily ventured to the local bank—a rare occurrence for the reclusive family. As they waited in line, Lily’s eyes were filled with wonder. She clung to Draven’s hand, her gaze fixed on the adults around them.

As they approached the teller counter, the bank doors swung open dramatically. A group of fresh super villains walked in, their eyes glinting with malice and mischief. Panic spread among the customers as the villains declared their intention to rob the bank.", "passage_B": "Once upon a time, in the peaceful town of Harmonyville, there lived a retired super-villain called Draven. He had left his old life of crime behind him and now spent his days looking after his six-year-old daughter, Lily. One sunny morning, the two of them went to the bank, a rare outing for the reclusive family. Lily’s eyes were shining with excitement as she clung to Draven’s hand and stared curiously at the adults around her. Just as they were about to go up to the counter, the bank’s doors swung open and in walked a gang of new super-villains, their eyes gleaming with greed and mischief."}

